"thumb":{"h":150,"resize":"crop","w":150}},"type":"video","url":"https://t.co/ppDhdIzil5","video_info":{"aspect_ratio":[16,9],"duration_millis":36866,"variants":[{"content_type":"application/x-mpegURL","url":"https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2121794081101869057/pl/5jE9aqIM6WI1la6F.m3u8?tag=29&v=cfc"},{"bitrate":256000,"content_type":"video/mp4","url":"https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2121794081101869057/vid/avc1/480x270/fgtTd-pvXvFbki2w.mp4?tag=29"},{"bitrate":832000,"content_type":"video/mp4","url":"https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2121794081101869057/vid/avc1/640x360/sWGfQY4Jxaer2TKT.mp4?tag=29"},{"bitrate":2176000,"content_type":"video/mp4","url":"https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2121794081101869057/vid/avc1/1280x720/_TO6iTHj4WaEzpg0.mp4?tag=29"},{"bitrate":10368000,"content_type":"video/mp4","url":"https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2121794081101869057/vid/avc1/1920x1080/zB4IQ7UgyllrPTFI.mp4?tag=29"}]}}]},"favorite_count":1674,"favorited":false,"full_text":"【今月発表へ】防衛省・自衛隊の新たなAI戦略について\n\n防衛省は、今月、「防衛省AI活用推進基本方針」を見直し、新たな「Defense AI Vision」を発表します。\nAIは今、防衛力の発揮の仕方そのものを変えています。\nこの大きな変化を、日本を守る力に変えていく。 https://t.co/ppDhdIzil5","id_str":"2121798222666727589","is_quote_status":false,"lang":"ja","possibly_sensitive":false,"possibly_sensitive_editable":true,"quote_count":24,"reply_count":40,"retweet_count":326,"retweeted":false,"user_id_str":"268732024"},"note_tweet":{"is_expandable":true,"note_tweet_results":{"result":{"entity_set":{"hashtags":[],"smarttags":[],"symbols":[],"timestamps":[],"urls":[],"user_mentions":[]},"id":"Tm90ZVR3ZWV0OjIxMjE3OTgyMjI2MDc5OTQ4ODA=","text":"【今月発表へ】防衛省・自衛隊の新たなAI戦略について\n\n防衛省は、今月、「防衛省AI活用推進基本方針」を見直し、新たな「Defense AI Vision」を発表します。\nAIは今、防衛力の発揮の仕方そのものを変えています。\nこの大きな変化を、日本を守る力に変えていく。\n防衛省・自衛隊は、AIによってどう変わるのか。\nその新たな方向性を、このビジョンで示します。"}}},"rest_id":"2121798222666727589","unmention_data":{},"views":{"count":"187783","state":"EnabledWithCount"}}},"rest_id":"2126116217601851405","unmention_data":{},"views":{"count":"38937","stat